  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The projectile slams into your Adam’s apple, distorting the cartilage of your windpipe and closing your airways. You start to choke.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain @Condition[Fatigued] (1) and will gain another level of @Condition[Fatigued] at the end of each of your subsequent turns until the cartilage is popped back into place. This requires either a <strong>Hard (-20) Heal</strong> Test by yourself or a <strong>Challenging (+0) Heal</strong> Test by someone else. If successful all @Condition[Fatigued] Conditions are removed but you won’t be able to speak for a week. If you reach @Condition[Fatigued] (10) you go @Condition[Unconscious] and die from suffocation in another Toughness Bonus rounds. You don’t get to roll for any Pummel Quality.</p>"
    },
